	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Zilog CWM 0.5 GI V1 PIR Lens\n\nThe CWM 0.5 GI V1 lens array is intended for both wall and ceiling-mounted applications, and is optimized for both dual and quad element pyroelectric detectors. The lens is intended to clip directly into the circuit board, over top of the pyroelectric sensor.\n\nhttp://media.digikey.com/pdf/Data%20Sheets/ZiLOG%20PDFs/Zmotion%20Lens%20&%20Pyroelectric%20Sensor%20Spec.pdf Datasheet")
